{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-06-13 19:00:00', 'title': 'NATIONAL VISION HOLDINGS SET TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NATIONAL VISION HOLDINGS INC. (NASD: EYE) WILL REPLACE RENEWABLE ENERGY GROUP INC. (NASD: REGI) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON THURSDAY, JUNE 16. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT CHEVRON CORP. (NYSE: CVX) ACQUIRED RENEWABLE ENERGY GROUP IN A DEAL THAT CLOSED TODAY, JUNE 13.'}